1. Cook the bread in the toaster:
   ```
   (:goal
       (cooked bread)
   )
   ```

2. Move the cooked bread to dualdesk_1:
   ```
   (:goal
       (item_on bread dualdesk_1)
   )
   ```

3. Boil the water in the kettle:
   ```
   (:goal
       (boiled kettle)
   )
   ```

4. Move the boiled kettle to dualdesk_1:
   ```
   (:goal
       (item_on kettle dualdesk_1)
   )
   ```

5. Cook cup ramen with the water dispenser:
   ```
   (:goal
       (cooked cup_ramen)
   )
   ```

6. Move the cooked cup ramen to dualdesk_1:
   ```
   (:goal
       (item_on cup_ramen dualdesk_1)
   )
   ```